      {
        "id": "triangles",
        "title": "三角形：选公式与判多解",
        "summary": "边与其对角对应，先判断资料类型。",
        "method": [
          {
            "title": "方法",
            "body": "直角三角形用 $a^2+b^2=c^2$ 和六个三角比。一般三角形：$A+B+C=180^\\circ$，$a/\\sin A=b/\\sin B=c/\\sin C$，$c^2=a^2+b^2-2ab\\cos C$。SSA 用反正弦后还须检查补角是否使角和小于 $180^\\circ$。面积 $K=ab\\sin C/2=\\sqrt{s(s-a)(s-b)(s-c)}$，$s=(a+b+c)/2$。"
          }
        ],
        "pitfalls": [
          "外角不是三角形内角；边长须正，三边须满足严格三角不等式。"
        ],
        "en": {
          "title": "Triangles: formulas and ambiguity",
          "summary": "Match sides with opposite angles and classify the given data.",
          "method": [
            {
              "title": "Method",
              "body": "For a right triangle use $a^2+b^2=c^2$ and the six ratios. In any triangle, $A+B+C=180^\\circ$, $a/\\sin A=b/\\sin B=c/\\sin C$, and $c^2=a^2+b^2-2ab\\cos C$. For SSA, also test the supplementary inverse-sine angle against the angle sum. Area: $K=ab\\sin C/2=\\sqrt{s(s-a)(s-b)(s-c)}$, $s=(a+b+c)/2$."
            }
          ],
          "pitfalls": [
            "An exterior angle is not an interior angle. Side lengths must be positive and satisfy strict triangle inequalities."
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "vectors",
        "title": "向量、点积、投影与功",
        "summary": "分量分别相加，长度与方向另算。",
        "method": [
          {
            "title": "方法",
            "body": "$\\overrightarrow{PQ}=\\langle x_Q-x_P,y_Q-y_P\\rangle$，$\\|v\\|=\\sqrt{v_x^2+v_y^2}$，方向为 $\\langle r\\cos\\theta,r\\sin\\theta\\rangle$。$v\\cdot w=v_xw_x+v_yw_y=\\|v\\|\\|w\\|\\cos\\theta$；非零向量的夹角在 $[0,\\pi]$。$\\operatorname{proj}_w v=(v\\cdot w)w/\\|w\\|^2$，要求 $w\\ne0$。功 $W=F\\cdot d$。"
          }
        ],
        "pitfalls": [],
        "en": {
          "title": "Vectors, dot products, projections, and work",
          "summary": "Add components separately; calculate magnitude and direction afterward.",
          "method": [
            {
              "title": "Method",
              "body": "$\\overrightarrow{PQ}=\\langle x_Q-x_P,y_Q-y_P\\rangle$, $\\|v\\|=\\sqrt{v_x^2+v_y^2}$, and a vector of magnitude $r$ and direction $\\theta$ is $\\langle r\\cos\\theta,r\\sin\\theta\\rangle$. $v\\cdot w=v_xw_x+v_yw_y=\\|v\\|\\|w\\|\\cos\\theta$; the angle between nonzero vectors lies in $[0,\\pi]$. $\\operatorname{proj}_w v=(v\\cdot w)w/\\|w\\|^2$ requires $w\\ne0$. Work is $W=F\\cdot d$."
            }
          ],
          "pitfalls": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "polar",
        "title": "极坐标与直角坐标",
        "summary": "负半径沿指定射线的反方向取点。",
        "method": [
          {
            "title": "方法",
            "body": "$x=r\\cos\\theta,y=r\\sin\\theta,r^2=x^2+y^2$。若指定 $r>0$，取 $r=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$，角按象限选到指定区间。极坐标可用负半径；方程转换须核对原点、除数与平方引入的分支。"
          }
        ],
        "pitfalls": [],
        "en": {
          "title": "Polar and rectangular coordinates",
          "summary": "A negative radius locates a point opposite the specified ray.",
          "method": [
            {
              "title": "Method",
              "body": "$x=r\\cos\\theta$, $y=r\\sin\\theta$, $r^2=x^2+y^2$. When $r>0$ is required, take $r=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$ and select the angle by quadrant in the requested interval. Polar coordinates allow negative radii; equation conversions must check the pole, divisors, and branches introduced by squaring."
            }
          ],
          "pitfalls": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "complex",
        "title": "复数极形式与全部复根",
        "summary": "模相乘除，辐角相加减；根须枚举不同辐角。",
        "method": [
          {
            "title": "方法",
            "body": "$z=r(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)$，$r\\ge0$。DeMoivre 定理：$z^n=r^n(\\cos n\\theta+i\\sin n\\theta)$；负整数次幂须 $z\\ne0$。非零 $z$ 的 $n$ 次根为 $r^{1/n}[\\cos((\\theta+360^\\circ k)/n)+i\\sin((\\theta+360^\\circ k)/n)]$，$k=0,\\ldots,n-1$。"
          }
        ],
        "pitfalls": [],
        "en": {
          "title": "Polar complex numbers and all roots",
          "summary": "Multiply or divide moduli and add or subtract arguments; enumerate distinct root arguments.",
          "method": [
            {
              "title": "Method",
              "body": "$z=r(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)$, $r\\ge0$. DeMoivre: $z^n=r^n(\\cos n\\theta+i\\sin n\\theta)$; negative integer powers require $z\\ne0$. The $n$th roots of nonzero $z$ are $r^{1/n}[\\cos((\\theta+360^\\circ k)/n)+i\\sin((\\theta+360^\\circ k)/n)]$, $k=0,\\ldots,n-1$."
            }
          ],
          "pitfalls": []
        }
      }
